    "label": "利用式 (8.20) 中的差分方程实现反馈回路时，计算机指令需要通过代码进行连续循环：READ A/D: y, r; e=r-y; u=0.7778 u_p+45.56[e-0.9510 e_p]; OUTPUT D/A: u; u_p=u; e_p=e; 距离上次 READ 经过 T 秒后返回 READ。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The instructions to the computer to implement the feedback loop with the difference equation from Eq. (8.20) call for a continual looping through code: READ A/D: y, r; e=r-y; u=0.7778 u_p+45.56[e-0.9510 e_p]; OUTPUT D/A: u; u_p=u; e_p=e; go back to READ when T sec have elapsed since last READ.",
